Plan (what we’ll create)
	1.	Objects & relationships:
	•	Standard Account & Contact (use existing).
	•	Custom objects: Order and Order Item (OrderLine).
	•	Relationship: Order → Account (lookup), Order Item → Order (master-detail).
	2.	Fields & page layouts for both objects.
	3.	Lightning App, Tabs, and record pages for easy demo.
	4.	Sample records to enter.
	5.	Automations:
	•	Auto-number for Order.
	•	Validation rule (Order must have an Account, Order Items must have Quantity > 0).
	•	Record-Triggered Flow: When Order Item created/edited, update Order Total (roll-up).
	•	Record-Triggered Flow: When Order is placed (Status = Confirmed), send email alert to Account owner.
	•	Path on Order to show stages (Draft → Confirmed → Shipped → Closed).
	6.	Reports & Dashboard: Orders by Status and Top Accounts by Order Value.
	7.	Demo script with exact steps and expected outcomes.

