4 — Validation Rules

Object Manager → Order Item → Validation Rules → New

A. Prevent zero/negative quantity

Rule Name: Qty_Positive
Error Condition Formula:Quantity__c <= 0
Error Message: Quantity must be greater than 0.
Error Location: Field: Quantity__c

B. Ensure Order has Account (optional)

Object Manager → Order → Validation Rules → New
Rule Name: Order_Account_Required
Error Condition Formula:ISBLANK(AccountId)
Error Message: Order must be associated with an Account.

