8 — Demo script (step-by-step with expected results)

Follow these steps in sequence; read the “Expected” text after each action.

Demo Setup (before starting)
	•	Open the Demo Order Management app you created.

Step 1 — Show accounts
	•	Action: Click Accounts tab → open Acme Corp.
	•	Expected: Account detail page appears.

Step 2 — Create a new order
	•	Action: Click Orders → New → fill:
	•	Account: Acme Corp
	•	Order Date: today
	•	Status: Draft
	•	Save.
	•	Expected: Order record created with Order Number ORD-0001 and Order Total 0 (before items). You can mention the number.

Step 3 — Add first Order Item
	•	Action: On Order page → Related → New Order Item:
	•	Product Name: Widget A, Unit Price: 1000, Quantity: 2. Save.
	•	Expected: Order Item is saved. Line Total shows 2000. After Flow runs, Order Total updates to 2000 (may be immediate in after-save flow).

