10 — Troubleshooting tips (common issues)
	•	If Order Total doesn’t update: confirm Flow is Active, running After Save, and that the Get Records query uses correct Order Id.
	•	If email not sent: check that recipient email exists and Org Email Deliverability is set to All email (Setup → Email → Deliverability).
	•	If picklist values missing on page: add the field to the layout & save.
	•	For delete handling of Order Items, create a separate Record-Triggered Flow on delete to recalc totals.

